# Prisma migrations live in backend/prisma/migrations and MUST stay tracked, so
# there is deliberately no ignore rule for them here.
#
# Keep every `.env` ignore above this line and this negation directly below it.
# Git resolves patterns last-match-wins, so a broader `.env*` appended after
# this point silently shadows the negation and drops all four .env.example
# templates (root, ai/, backend/, frontend/) from a fresh clone.
!.env.example
